# Shell scripts and unit/config files are executed on Ubuntu. A CRLF shebang there fails
# as `/usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory`, and a CRLF systemd unit or nginx
# conf parses just as badly. This repo is authored on Windows, so pin the endings rather
# than relying on every clone having core.autocrlf set the same way.
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.service       text eol=lf
deploy/nginx/*  text eol=lf
deploy/env.example text eol=lf
